{"externalId":"24516","title":"La sacralisation du pouvoir","issuedDate":"2003","language":"fr","locc":null,"creators":[{"name":"Dierkens, Alain","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Marx, Jacques","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Decharneux, Baudouin","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Meulder, Marcel","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Beyer de Ryke, Benoît","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Preyat, Fabrice","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Schreiber, Jean-Philippe","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Hasquin, Hervé","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Benoist, Jacques","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Godo, Emmanuel","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Yannou, Hervé","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Daled, Pierre Frédéric","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Poulat, Émile","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Morelli, Anne","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null}],"subjects":[],"bookshelves":["Category: History and Archaeology"],"formats":[{"url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/24516/4/9782800413242.pdf","formatType":"pdf"},{"url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/24516/3/1005597.pdf.txt","formatType":"txt"},{"url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/24516/6/9782800413242.pdf.txt","formatType":"txt"}],"lastModified":"2024-03-22","summary":"L'ouvrage est né d'une réflexion de caractère historique portant sur les modes d'articulation, dans la société civile, d'une théologie politique. Cette dernière n'a pas été examinée du point de vue théorique, en particulier dans le cadre classique des relations de l'Église et de l'État, mais sous l'angle anthropologique. Ce sont donc toutes les formes de manifestation d'un donné à voir qui sont ici concernées : gestes, formes, rituels, mises en scène, par lesquels le pouvoir tente d'affirmer sa légitimation.","coverUrl":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/24516/5/9782800413242.jpg"}